<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>PDF-Teste</title>
    <style>
        body{
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }
        .containeir{
            margin-left: 1rem;
        }
        .logo{
            size: 6px !important;
            margin-bottom: 0rem;
        }
        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .text-italic {
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .text-light {
            color: #a1a1a1;
        }
        .tabela-center {
            margin-left: 5rem;
        }
        .m-1{
            margin: 1rem;
            padding: 0rem;
        }
        .fw-bold{
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .mt-1{
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .mt-2{
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .mt-3{
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        .row{
            display: inline-block
        }
        .table-bordered {
    border-collapse: collapse; /* CSS2 */
}
 
.table-bordered td {
    border: 1px solid black;
}
 
.table-bordered th {
    border: 1px solid black;
    background: #878383;
    font-weight: bold;
}

ol {
    list-style: start;
}
.lateral{
    position: absolute;
    right: 5rem;
    top: 20.6rem;
}
.table-secondary {
    background-color: #cdcccc;
}
.m-r{
    margin-right: 14rem;
}
.m-r2{
    margin-right: 16rem;
}
.mt-5{
    margin-right: 20rem;

}
.visto{
    position: absolute;
    top: 5rem;
    margin-left: 6rem;
}
p{
    margin: 0.3px;
    padding: 0px;
}
.text-size-10 {
    font-size: 13pt;
}
.text-size-12 {
    font-size: 20pt;
}
.text-danger {
    color: red;
}
.text-start {
    text-align: start;
}
.text-sub {
    text-decoration: underline;
}
table {
    margin-left: 6rem;
}
.lg-2 {
    width: 3rem;
}
.lg-4 {
    width: 10rem;
}
.lg-6 {
    width: 20rem;
}
.lg-7 {
    width: 25rem;
}
.lg-8 {
    width: 30rem;
}
.p-3 {
    margin-left: 3rem;
    margin-right: 3rem;
}

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="containeir text-size-10">

        <div class="logo text-center"><img src="http://localhost:8081/img/logor.png" class="logor" alt="Logo"></div>
        <div class="text-center">
            <p>República de Angola</p>
            <p>Ministério da Educação</p>
            <p>Governo da Província do Bié</p>
            <p class="fw-bold" >LICEU REI NDUNDUMA DO CUITO</p>
            
            <div class="mt-1 lead fw-bold text-danger h4 text-sub"> <%= curso.descricao %> </div>
            <div class="mt-1"> <span>Ano Lectivo:</span> <span class="fw-bold" > <%= anoCod %> </span> &shy; &shy; &shy; &shy; <span> <%= classe.designacao %> </span> &shy; &shy; <span>Turma:</span> <span class="fw-bold"> <%= turmaCod %> </span> &shy; &shy; <span>Período: </span> <span class="fw-bold"> <%= periodo %> </span>  </div>
            <div class="h4 mt-2 ">LISTA DOS ALUNOS</div>

            <!-- VITO -->
            <div class="visto">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fw-bold">A Directora</div>
                    <span>___________________</span><br>
                    <span>Lic. Emília Carla Adelino Cawaia
                    </span><br>
                    <span class="text-size-10" >___/____/<%= anoCod %>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="px-5 tabela-center">

                <table class="table table-bordered">
                    <thead class="fw-bold bg-light table-secondary">
                        <tr><td>Nº</td> <td>NOME COMPLETO</td> <td>SEXO</td> <td>OBSERVAÇÃO</td> </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <% for(let i = 0; i < alunos.length; i++) { %>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="lg-2" > <%= i+1 %> </td>
                                <td class="text-start lg-7" > <%= alunos[i].nome.toLowerCase().replace(/(?:^|\s)\S/g, function(a) {return a.toUpperCase();}); %></td>
                                <td class="lg-2" > <%= alunos[i].genero %> </td>
                                <td class="lg-4" ></td>
                                
                            </tr>
                            
                            <% } %>
                        </tbody>
                </table>
                </div>
            
        </div>
        <div class="">

            <div class="data mt-2 text-center">
                <span class="fw-bold mt-2" >Obs.</span> Apenas os estudantes que reconfirmaram a matrícua constam na lista.
            </div>
            <div class="data mt-1 text-center">
                Liceu Rei Ndunduma no Cuito aos <%= dia %> de <%= mes %> de <%= ano %>.
            </div>

            <div class="fw-bold mt-1 text-center">
    
                <span >O Subdirector Pedagógico</span> <br>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
    
                <span>_________________________</span><br>
                 <span>MSc. Frederico Sanji Figueiredo</span><br>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="text-center text-light">
        <hr class="p-3">
        <div class="text-sm text-center text-italic">Gerado pelo Sistema de Gestão escolar do Liceu Rei Ndunduma-Cuito <span>(SIGEB-L290) </span> // <%= dia %> de <%= mes %> de <%= ano %>.</div>
    </aside>
    </body>
</html>